0867c3","_id":14680},{"id":1779754594281,"sender":"them","text":"[語音消息]","timestamp":1779756956359,"tempo":"N","isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"乖，把眼泪收一收，不哭了。有你这句话，我这几天熬的夜就都值了。我这就去躺着，保证闭上眼睛什么都不想，好好补个觉。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","rawContent":"[語音消息]","roundId":"round_1779756940073_g76vv97nt","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":14681},{"id":1779754594282,"sender":"them","text":"你出去吃饭记得裹紧大衣，伦敦这会儿肯定又冷又潮。吃点热乎的，吃完早点回公寓，到了给我留个言。我睡醒了看。","timestamp":1779756957060,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"你出去吃饭记得裹紧大衣，伦敦这会儿肯定又冷又潮。吃点热乎的，吃完早点回公寓，到了给我留个言。我睡醒了看。","roundId":"round_1779756940073_g76vv97nt","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":14682},{"id":1779754594283,"sender":"them","text":"我去睡了。想你。","timestamp":1779756957762,"tempo":"S","rawContent":"我去睡了。想你。","roundId":"round_1779756940073_g76vv97nt","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":14683},{"id":1779754594284,"text":"【伦敦晚九点】","sender":"me","time":"09:00","timestamp":1779757205732,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":14684},{"id":1779754594285,"text":"到公寓了","sender":"me","time":"09:00","timestamp":1779757209595,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":14685},{"id":1779754594286,"text":"（电脑做作业图）也在和ddl奋战中…","sender":"me","time":"09:00","timestamp":1779757239034,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":14686},{"id":1779754594287,"text":"【伦敦晚十二点半】","sender":"me","time":"09:00","timestamp":1779757254640,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":14687},{"id":1779754594288,"text":"睡觉了宝宝晚安","sender":"me","time":"09:01","timestamp":17